sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Borrower as Borrower (Member)
    participant UI as React SPA (Discovery & Requests)
    participant RPC as PostgreSQL SECURITY DEFINER RPCs
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database (btree_gist)
    actor Admin as Organization Admin

    Borrower->>UI: Selects Interval & Submits Booking Request
    UI->>RPC: request_booking(p_resource_id, p_start, p_end, p_purpose, p_supervisor)
    RPC->>DB: Asserts caller is_verified_member() & belongs to current_institution_id()
    RPC->>DB: Validates eligibility_rules (user_type, lead_time, duration, qualifications)

    alt Ungoverned Resource (requires_approval = false)
        RPC->>DB: Atomic GiST overlap check -> status = 'approved'
        RPC-->>UI: Booking Created (Status: approved)
    else Governed Resource (requires_approval = true)
        RPC->>DB: Sets initial status = 'pending' (Approval Lock Engaged)
        RPC->>DB: Inserts audit_log ('booking.created')
        RPC->>DB: Dispatches notification to all organization admins
        RPC-->>UI: Booking Created (Status: pending)
    end

    Note over Borrower, Admin: Defensive Lock Phase: Handover Blocked
    Borrower->>UI: Attempts Early Check-Out while Pending
    UI->>RPC: check_out_booking(p_booking_id, ...)
    RPC->>DB: Evaluates status = 'pending'
    RPC-->>UI: PostgresError: booking_pending_approval (400 Bad Request)
    UI-->>Borrower: Alert: "Waiting for admin approval. You can check out once approved."

    Note over Admin, DB: Administrative Decision Phase (Row-Level Locking)
    Admin->>UI: Opens Admin Request Queue (/app/institution/requests)
    UI-->>Admin: Displays Pending Requests with Overlap Conflict Warnings
    Admin->>UI: Selects Booking & Enters Decision Note
    Admin->>RPC: decide_booking(p_booking_id, p_approve, p_note)
    RPC->>DB: Acquires exclusive row lock: SELECT * FROM bookings FOR UPDATE
    RPC->>DB: Asserts caller is_institution_admin(booking.institution_id)

    alt Admin Approves (p_approve = true)
        RPC->>DB: Re-checks GiST overlap against approved/checked_out slots
        alt Conflicting Slot Found
            RPC-->>UI: Exception: slot_taken
        else Slot Free
            RPC->>DB: Updates status = 'approved', decided_by = admin_id, decided_at = now()
            RPC->>DB: Logs audit_log ('booking.approved')
            RPC->>DB: Dispatches in-app notification to borrower
            RPC-->>UI: Booking Approved
        end
    else Admin Rejects (p_approve = false)
        RPC->>DB: Updates status = 'rejected', decision_note = p_note
        RPC->>DB: Logs audit_log ('booking.rejected')
        RPC-->>UI: Booking Rejected
    end

    alt Admin Emergency Cancellation
        Admin->>RPC: admin_cancel_booking(p_booking_id, p_note)
        RPC->>DB: Asserts status in ('pending', 'approved')
        RPC->>DB: Updates status = 'cancelled', decision_note = p_note
        RPC->>DB: Re-pools slot to waitlist entries or peer release
    end
